{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはたんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日日本中いや、世界中で\n1番暑かった場所ってどこ\nだと思うーーー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんうんそれはね、ここ‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/08/24/1435079/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡名物水炊き食べに行ったよ♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"調味料の中でも結構好きな\nランキングの上位に来る\n柚子胡椒ちゃん♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柚子胡椒食べれてお腹があつあつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいや...(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え？え？...え？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ..ごめんごめん。\n食べログになってきてるような\n気がするよこのブログ...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡ライブも最高に盛り上がって\nくれて本当に嬉しかったです☆\nそれにあたしの推しうちわ的な物\nもたくさん発見して幸せでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しいていうなら豚骨ラーメンが\n食べられなかったっていう心残り。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、本当に本当に福岡の\nふぁみたん盛り上がって\n頂いてありがとうごがいます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/08/24/1435079/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡の皆すいとーよ♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}